From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Android Port <arena@arena.ai>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:57:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: topaz: drop input-enable from touch pinctrl
 states

The khaje TLMM binding (via qcom,tlmm-common) does not
allow input-enable in pin states - Qualcomm TLMM GPIOs
are input-capable without it. CI run 41229713167 failed
the dtbs_check gate on ts-int-active/suspend-state only.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts
index abf2efd17..af6837db0 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6225-xiaomi-topaz.dts
@@ -548,7 +548,6 @@ ts_int_active: ts-int-active-state {
 		function = "gpio";
 		drive-strength = <8>;
 		bias-pull-up;
-		input-enable;
 	};
 
 	ts_int_suspend: ts-int-suspend-state {
@@ -556,7 +555,6 @@ ts_int_suspend: ts-int-suspend-state {
 		function = "gpio";
 		drive-strength = <2>;
 		bias-pull-down;
-		input-enable;
 	};
 
 	ts_reset_active: ts-reset-active-state {
-- 
2.39.5

